<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>卷四御集 - 分类 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E5%9B%9B%E5%BE%A1%E9%9B%86/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.161.0 &amp; FixIt v0.4.5</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Sat, 30 May 2026 12:48:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E5%9B%9B%E5%BE%A1%E9%9B%86/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>老治法：论老人宜补肾</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/4-5-laozhifa/</link><pubDate>Sat, 30 May 2026 12:45:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/4-5-laozhifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E5%9B%9B%E5%BE%A1%E9%9B%86/">卷四御集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“老治法”部分，专论&lt;strong&gt;老年人气血衰少、肾水枯涸&lt;/strong&gt;的调治法则。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;老人之虚，根在肾水不足。当以补肾为主，兼健脾胃、化痰食，丸药常服，煎方随症加减&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item><item><title>产后治法：论产后宜补 附胎产金丹 回生丹</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/4-4-chanhouzhifa/</link><pubDate>Fri, 29 May 2026 21:13:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/4-4-chanhouzhifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E5%9B%9B%E5%BE%A1%E9%9B%86/">卷四御集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“产后治法”部分，专论&lt;strong&gt;产后诸症&lt;/strong&gt;的辨治法则，并附&lt;strong&gt;胎产金丹、回生丹&lt;/strong&gt;的详细用法。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;产后气血大亏，腠理空疏，当以大补气血为主，略佐祛邪之品；不可照无病之人而重用逐邪之方&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item><item><title>产前治法：论子悬 论漏胎 论胎动 论横生倒养 附胎产金丹 回生丹</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/4-3-chanqianzhifa/</link><pubDate>Fri, 29 May 2026 17:22:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/4-3-chanqianzhifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E5%9B%9B%E5%BE%A1%E9%9B%86/">卷四御集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“产前治法”部分，专论&lt;strong&gt;子悬、漏胎、胎动、横生倒养（难产）&lt;strong&gt;等产前及临产危急重症的辨治法则，并附&lt;/strong&gt;胎产金丹、回生丹&lt;/strong&gt;二方。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;产前诸症，多因气血亏虚、胎元不固或母体气衰所致，治当峻补气血、安胎固本，不可妄用攻伐催生&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item><item><title>贫治法：论贫贱不可与富贵同治</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/4-2-pinzhifa/</link><pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 18:18:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/4-2-pinzhifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E5%9B%9B%E5%BE%A1%E9%9B%86/">卷四御集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“贫治法”部分，专论&lt;strong&gt;贫贱劳苦之人的外感内伤病证治法则&lt;/strong&gt;。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;贫贱之人筋骨过劳、腠理致密、胃气健刚，体质与富贵之人迥异，故不可同法而治，当以健脾理气、兼散邪气为法&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item><item><title>富治法：论治膏粱宜补正气</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/4-1-fuzhifa/</link><pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 10:55:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/4-1-fuzhifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E5%9B%9B%E5%BE%A1%E9%9B%86/">卷四御集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“富治法”部分，专论&lt;strong&gt;膏粱富贵之人的外感病证治法则&lt;/strong&gt;。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;富贵之人腠理疏松、脾胃虚弱，一旦感邪，当以补正为先，祛邪为次。若一味攻邪而忽于补正，必生变端&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item></channel></rss>